rough the nasal passage  there will Factory neurons get all the  complex smells from the pizza and send  that information to the brain smell and  taste work together to help us enjoy  food when our nose isn't working  properly and food seems flavorless it's  because we're only tasting those basic  tastes without any of the complex odors  detected through smell so the next time  you Savor an amazing flavor thank your  nose our sense of smell is what brings  Nuance to what we eat
 

